  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee in a large cazuela over medium heat.",
    "Add the cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add the coriander powder and garam masala, and stir for 1 minute.",
    "Add the spinach puree, salt, and beer (if using), and stir well.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and let cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Cut the paneer into small cubes and add to the spinach mixture.",
    "Let the paneer cook in the spinach sauce for 5 minutes, or until it is fully coated.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot."
